# Huawei Cloud MaaS Statistics — environment template
# Copy to .env (or export these) and fill in. NEVER commit real secrets.
#
# For account security, create a DEDICATED IAM user used ONLY for MaaS and bill queries:
#   1) IAM -> Permissions -> Permission management -> Create custom policy (JSON view):
#        {"Version":"1.1","Statement":[{"Effect":"Allow","Action":["bss:billDetail:view"]}]}
#      (MaaS permissions are enabled by default; only billing needs this policy)
#   2) Create a user group and attach that policy.
#   3) Create an IAM user in that group, access type = programmatic access only,
#      then generate its access key (AK/SK) and use it below.

# === Required ===============================================================
HWCLOUD_AK=your-access-key-id
HWCLOUD_SK=your-secret-access-key
HWCLOUD_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id

# === Optional ===============================================================
# Region defaults to ap-southeast-1.
# HWCLOUD_REGION=ap-southeast-1
# Timezone defaults to the detected user timezone.
# HWCLOUD_TIMEZONE=Asia/Shanghai
# Override the MaaS endpoint host:
# MAAS_ENDPOINT=
